From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 11:18:15 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] fix(desktop): an unavailable authoritative work
 source holds an idle row off done/green

Failed tasks/process/subagent/lineage reads publish a qualified veto (connection, profile, stored id, source); a completed outcome cannot paint done while a source is unknown or work is background/blocked/waiting. Recovery clears only that source on a successful read. Never writes tasks/outcomes.
